### Tankerkönig API (Germany)
### Real-time fuel prices for gas stations in Germany
### Docs: https://creativecommons.tankerkoenig.de/

@baseUrl = https://creativecommons.tankerkoenig.de/json
@apiKey = {{GERMANY_TANKERKOENIG_KEY}}

### List stations near Berlin
GET {{baseUrl}}/list.php?lat=52.5200&lng=13.4050&rad=10&sort=dist&type=all&apikey={{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### List stations near Munich
GET {{baseUrl}}/list.php?lat=48.1351&lng=11.5820&rad=10&sort=dist&type=all&apikey={{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Station detail (replace with station ID from list)
@stationId = REPLACE_ME
GET {{baseUrl}}/detail.php?id={{stationId}}&apikey={{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Prices for multiple stations (replace with comma-separated IDs)
@ids = REPLACE_ME
GET {{baseUrl}}/prices.php?ids={{ids}}&apikey={{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json
